# How many distinct values: Unique, then Count. The compiler counts the set
# Unique would have built and never builds the deduplicated list.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Cursed Technique: Map Each
    Using: (x) -> x * 31 % 50021
Cursed Technique: Unique
Maximum Technique: Count
Reveal: stdout
